      "text": "[9:17PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement of vehicles is smooth along the service lane, Anthony inward Maryland intersection, onwards Odo'yalaro and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way.\n\nThe entire stretch of Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way is good.\n\nTraffic is free along Kodesoh Road, Oba Akran Road/Bridge, Local Airport Road/Bridge, Oba Akinjobi Way, and Ikeja G.R.A.\n\nOur officers are effectively controlling traffic at their respective locations, ensuring a smooth flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
