      "text": "[9:36PM] #OguduAlapere #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic has eased from Gbagada Bridge and Olopomeji down to Ifako.\nMovement from Ifako to Ogudu is slow but steady due to construction at the Ifako/Ogudu link bridge.\nAfter Ifako/Ogudu bridge, movement through Ogudu, Alapere Estate to Apostolic Church is smoother.\nFrom Apostolic Church to Ojota Bridge, Ikosi Junction, and down to Otedola Bridge, traffic is free-flowing. \nThe return journey from Otedola Bridge to Secretariat and back to Car Wash is also moving well.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
